# Femur is a single repository with independently configured applications.
# Each app owns its own environment file — there is no shared root .env.
#
#   frontend/.env.example   → copy to frontend/.env.local
#   backend/.env.example    → (Phase 2, not yet created) DATABASE_URL, REDIS_URL, SESSION_SECRET,
#                             payment/SMS/email/WhatsApp/LLM provider credentials (server-side only)
#   nira/.env.example       → (Phase 8, not yet created)
#
# Never commit real secrets. Never put secrets in NEXT_PUBLIC_* variables.
